    "---\n",
    "## 5. 📉 Precision-Recall Curve — High-Recall Threshold\n",
    "\n",
    "The threshold where **Recall ≥ 0.95** is our candidate for the **Moderate → High boundary (T2)**.\n",
    "Patients above T2 are flagged as **High Risk** and need urgent attention."
   ]
  },
